#!/bin/bash
D=$(cd "$(dirname "$0")" && pwd); . "$D/v"
exec > >(tee "$D/out_e.txt") 2>&1
R="$WORK/runs/e3a"; mkdir -p "$R"; cd "$R"
echo "== EXPERIMENT E3a START  $(date)"
sw_vers | tr '\n' ' '; echo; pmset -g batt | head -1; pmset -g custom | grep -iE "power:|powermode" | tr '\n' ' '; echo
cat "$WORK/LIBMLVC_COMMIT.txt" 2>/dev/null
n=0
for r in 1 2 3 4 5; do
  for m in turns alone-enc alone-dec duplex; do
    n=$((n+1)); echo "[$n/23] $(date +%H:%M:%S) round $r: $m (60 s run + 60 s rest)"
    "$BENCH" $m $P1 --fps 0 --seconds 60 --out-dir T_${m}_r$r 2> T_${m}_r$r.log
    grep -iE "resolved|FAILED|init" T_${m}_r$r.log | tr '\n' ' '; echo
    sleep 60
  done
done
for r in 1 2 3; do
  n=$((n+1)); echo "[$n/23] $(date +%H:%M:%S) turns paced 30 fps, run $r"
  "$BENCH" turns $P1 --fps 30 --seconds 60 --out-dir T_turns30_r$r 2> T_turns30_r$r.log
  sleep 60
done
echo "== EXPERIMENT E3a END  $(date)"
"$D/r"
